# macOS Finder metadata. Committed by accident in cc2ea89 and re-dirtied within a day —
# Finder rewrites it on any window interaction, so it churns every commit. Not a web
# exposure today (no .nojekyll, so Jekyll drops dotfiles), but the MECHANISM is the risk:
# whenever Finder next touches this directory while .claude/ or PROTOCOL_OVERRIDE_STATE.md
# is present, those names enter the blob and get committed — routing around the very
# exclusions above.
.DS_Store
